WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.175 --> 00:00:04.416
Create a task — start in Tasks, then Add task.

2
00:00:04.416 --> 00:00:09.292
Give your task a clear name and choose its due date.

3
00:00:09.292 --> 00:00:13.466
More options: set a time, priority, and estimated minutes.

4
00:00:13.466 --> 00:00:16.650
Email reminders are optional and need your reminder email configured.

5
00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:19.711
You can switch the form to Arabic without losing your entries.

6
00:00:19.711 --> 00:00:22.933
Review the details. Save is what creates the task.

7
00:00:22.933 --> 00:00:27.457
Your task is ready. Use its checkbox when you complete it.
